Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using inverse_error weights to see if it outperforms the best single model.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

